1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,850
Five paper balloons. Four rounds of wind.

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:08,380
Pick one. Ride the wind.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,080
Back a balloon in secret.

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,080
Two tailwinds add one space.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,330
Five wind cards decide the race.

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:25,600
Leader scores three. Second scores one. After four rounds, the overall leader pays five.

7
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:32,530
Solo against four AI levels, or two to six on one screen.

8
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:39,380
Picks stay secret. Autosave, replay, stats, and mobile are built in.

9
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:44,850
Balloon Rally. Five balloons. Four winds.
